(iii) introducing any domestic animal or allowing any domestic animal to stray;
(iv) damaging or destroying any vegetation:
Provided that the Government may for scientific purpose or for betterment of the Game Reserve or for the exploitation of forest produce or for any other purpose authorise the doing of any of the aforementioned prohibited acts:/
Provided further that alteration in boundaries may be allowed by the authorities competent to constitute the Game Sanctuary, National Park and Game Reserve.
